{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"ja","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-23004","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23004-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23004-0","text":"虚無の運命専属の光円錐、光円錐のスキルはこの運命にのみ有効。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23004-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23004-1","text":"「ヴェルト……か……」\n「この名前……かっこいいだろ？」\n「じゃあ……」\n「これからは、君がヴェルトだ」\n「律者コアと……世界を守る使命……」\n「頼んだぞ、ヴェルト」","speaker":""}]}
